  "$id": "urn:research-a:MaterialHypothesisPackage:1.0.0:execution-no-digest-profile-v1",
  "title": "MaterialHypothesisPackage",
  "description": "Full-discrete-Maxwell validated material hypotheses. Not a certificate of continuous physics or complete posterior support. All paths are local to the package. No truth fields belong in the online handoff. Execution overlay v1 permits null asset sha256; no digest is computed, verified or fabricated. Original schema is retained separately. Analytic Mie does not expose an internal constitutive numerical defect; null requires explicit NOT_EXPOSED_BY_ANALYTIC_MIE_INTERFACE status.",
